    </div>
    <svg class="chart" id="chart-ripple" viewBox="0 0 640 220" role="img" aria-label="A timeline from decision day to two years later, with lanes for markets, banks, homes and firms, and jobs and prices, showing a rate rise moving through them"></svg>
